### Task Tracker REST API - HTTP Request Test Collection
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081

### 1. Get Tracking Statistics (Metrics Dashboard)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/stats
Accept: application/json

### 2. Retrieve All Tasks
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Tasks by Status (PENDING, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, CANCELLED)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks?status=IN_PROGRESS
Accept: application/json

### 4. Filter Tasks by Priority (LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, URGENT)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks?priority=HIGH
Accept: application/json

### 5. Search Tasks by Keyword in Title or Description
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks?search=MySQL
Accept: application/json

### 6. Retrieve Task by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Retrieve Task by Non-Existent ID (Tests 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/9999
Accept: application/json

### 8. Create a New Daily Task
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Build Frontend Reporting View",
  "description": "Create charts for task distribution and completion velocities",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-05"
}

### 9. Create Task - Validation Failure (Tests 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Invalid task with blank title",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### 10. Update Existing Task Completely
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Design REST API Architecture (Finalized)",
  "description": "Controller-Service-Repository architecture with DTOs and global validation",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-28"
}

### 11. Quick Status Tracking Update (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/3/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 12. Delete Task by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/6
Accept: application/json
